  "@id": "schema:Blog",
  "@type": "rdfs:Class",
  "rdfs:label": "Blog",
  "rdfs:comment": "A [blog](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blog), sometimes known as a \"weblog\". Note that the individual posts ([[BlogPosting]]s) in a [[Blog]] are often colloquially referred to by the same term.",
